    "title": "Missing 24-year-old woman found 'safe,' police say - NewsBreak",
    "text": "A previously missing 24-year-old woman has been found. [DOWNLOAD: Free WHIO-TV News app for alerts as news breaks ] Springfield Police said in a social media post on Wednesday that Hailey Travis “has been located and is safe.” As previously reported by News Center 7 , Springfield Police reported Travis missing on June 4. Police said she was last seen in the area of Main and Florence Streets. TRENDING STORIES: The department said on Facebook that they want to thank everyone who shared their original social media post, offered support, and helped spread the word. “Your concern and assistance makes a difference!” the department said. [SIGN UP: WHIO-TV Daily Headlines Newsletter ]",
